// _Can_memcmp_elements<_元素1, _元素2> reports whether `_元素1 == _元素2` can be optimized to memcmp.
// Here, _元素1 and _元素2 aren't top-level const, because we remove_const_t before using _Can_memcmp_elements.

// Integral types are eligible for memcmp in very specific cases.
